      "id": "translation.executable-engine",
      "kind": "translation",
      "status": "experimental",
      "owner": "translate",
      "targets": [
        "x86_64"
      ],
      "docs": [
        "docs/architecture.md"
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "the native version-1 engine runs only inside a little-endian AArch64 ELF or Mach-O process and accepts only an x86-64 guest; AArch64-to-x86-64 and every other guest/host pair remain unavailable",
        "execution is restricted to lowering schema 9's published canonical full-width scalar-register MOV, ADD/SUB, AND/OR/XOR, register-only CMP 39/3B, register/immediate CMP 81/7, 83/7, and 3D, register-only TEST 85, and register/immediate TEST F7/0 and A9 subset terminated by C3 RET, C2 iw RET imm16, EB cb, E9 cd, or canonical legacy-prefix-free traditional Jcc: JO/JNO short 70/71 cb or near 0F 80/81 cd, JB/JAE 72/73 cb or 0F 82/83 cd, JE/JNE 74/75 cb or 0F 84/85 cd, JBE/JA 76/77 cb or 0F 86/87 cd, JS/JNS 78/79 cb or 0F 88/89 cd, JP/JNP 7A/7B cb or 0F 8A/8B cd, JL/JGE 7C/7D cb or 0F 8C/8D cd, and JLE/JG 7E/7F cb or 0F 8E/8F cd; TEST preserves AF in the NeverD state model",
        "the sealed linker re-audits the object and JITLink graph through allocation, resolution, fixup, finalization, credential binding, invocation, and deterministic unload; the dispatcher executes one audited block at a time, follows an unconditional branch only to its exact static target, and accepts a published canonical Jcc only at the taken or fallthrough successor declared by that block's manifest",
        "reserved F7 /1, ordinary guest-memory instructions, partial registers, legacy prefixes, semantically redundant REX extension bits, JRCXZ/JECXZ/JCXZ, LOOP/LOOPE/LOOPNE, every other conditional branch outside the exact published traditional-Jcc slice, indirect branches, calls, floating-point, SIMD, x87, atomics, system instructions, general exception propagation, block caching, debugging, and every encoding or LowIR operation outside the exact subset fail closed",
        "the executable session is currently a C++ API; no C, Python, CLI, or JSON execution surface is published"
      ],
      "tests": [
        "TranslationJITLinker.InvokesAuditedDirectBranchWithoutInventingRuntimeReferences",
        "TranslationJITLinker.InvokesAuditedZeroFlagBranchesWithoutRuntimeReferences",
        "TranslationJITLinker.InvokesAuditedSingleFlagBranchesWithoutRuntimeReferences",
        "TranslationJITLinker.InvokesEveryMultiFlagBranchTruthTableWithoutRuntimeReferences",
        "TranslationJITLinker.InvokesAuditedX86ReturnThroughFinalizedAArch64Code",
        "TranslationJITLinker.RejectsRuntimeStateAtWrongEntryPCWithoutMutatingInvocationInputs",
        "NativeTranslationSession.DispatchesDirectBranchIntoASecondAuditedBlock",
        "NativeTranslationSession.ValidatesAResolvedConditionalBranchAgainstBothManifestSuccessors",
        "NativeTranslationSession.DispatchesBothSelectedSuccessorsOfAZeroFlagBranch",
